  "description": "I did wish upon a mysterious painting to live a new life, but I didn't think that'd mean becoming Viola, a villain bound to die for copying her friend Robina's art and stealing her lovers! Still, I've got one good chance at survival if I stay away from Robina's men and use a different art style... if not for the fact that Robina now wants me to seduce Duke Depheloa, the male lead who's destined to kill me! But can I still turn this story around and get the happy ending Viola never had?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
